# Package profile: one package per line, added on top of configs/mx4300-nss.config.
#   name        build the package into the image
#   -name       leave a package that would otherwise be included out of the image
# Packages must come from a feed in upstream/feeds.conf or a source in
# upstream/third-party.conf. The build fails if a listed package does not end
# up in the image (unknown name, missing feed, unmet dependency), so an upgrade
# never drops software silently.
#
# The default profile adds nothing.
